# horde scene — destructible decor demo (DESTRUCT_DESIGN.md)
# Spawn band at the bottom, goal at the top. A sidewalk cafe (tables/chairs) and
# a few street signs / traffic lights stand in the crowd's path: as the horde
# arrives they shatter into flying debris; the tall ones topple first.
cell 0.5
world 100 70

spawn 2 1 96 4
goal 44 66 12 3

# --- cafe cluster (low objects: instant shatter into wood debris) ---
prop table 38 30 0
prop chair 36 30 0
prop chair 40 30 0
prop table 46 32 0
prop chair 44 32 0
prop chair 48 32 0
prop table 54 30 0
prop chair 52 30 0
prop chair 56 30 0

# --- street furniture (tall: topple then break into metal/glass) ---
prop trafsign 30 40 0
prop traflight 50 40 0
prop trafsign 70 40 0
prop traflight 62 30 0

# --- only 2 weak, short-range turrets near the goal: the horde reaches and
# smashes the decor before being thinned (authoring turrets here also disables
# the 10-turret demo auto-ring). turret x y [range] [heavy] [hp]
turret 40 58 16 0 250
turret 56 58 16 0 250
